    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Recommended Builds】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Explanation: </>In any development system, click the <Assistant_System>Recommended Builds</> button to navigate to the Recommended Builds system. You can use this to apply builds recommended by the system or top players to your own character based on your current development status.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage Guide: </>After entering the Recommended Builds system, you can click \"Use One-Click\" or click the copy button in the top right of each module to apply sets or individual tactics to your current build. Click the <Assistant_System>Share</> button in the bottom left of the build interface to share your current build with other Beyonders. Others can <Assistant_System>import</> shared builds via share codes or links.\n<Assistant_Title2>Overwrite Explanation: </>Overwritten builds are <Assistant_Red>smartly matched</> based on the recommended build and your character's current development, and will automatically equip suitable Beyonder Materials. Only Beyonders of the <Assistant_Red>same Pathway</> can share, import, and overwrite builds directly.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[非凡评分]|502}, {SendAnswer:[非凡方案]|508}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Recommended Builds】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Explanation: </>In any development system, click the <Assistant_System>Recommended Builds</> button to navigate to the Recommended Builds system. You can use this to apply builds recommended by the system or top players to your own character based on your current development status.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage Guide: </>After entering the Recommended Builds system, you can click \"Use One-Click\" or click the copy button in the top right of each module to apply sets or individual tactics to your current build. Click the <Assistant_System>Share</> button in the bottom left of the build interface to share your current build with other Beyonders. Others can <Assistant_System>import</> shared builds via share codes or links.\n<Assistant_Title2>Overwrite Explanation: </>Overwritten builds are <Assistant_Red>smartly matched</> based on the recommended build and your character's current development, and will automatically equip suitable Beyonder Materials. Only Beyonders of the <Assistant_Red>same Pathway</> can share, import, and overwrite builds directly.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Beyonder Rating]|502}, {SendAnswer:[Beyonder Schemes]|508}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【语音房-常驻房间】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统入口：</><Assistant_System>玩法语音房 - 右下角设置 - 右上方常驻按钮</>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1250316}\n<Assistant_Title2>常驻道具：</>可在<Assistant_System>商城 - 秘藏陈列</>中购买常驻契约，使用后可将玩法语音房间转换为常驻房间，并增加30天的常驻时长。单个道具可续时30天，连续续时上限为90天。\n<Assistant_Title2>功能介绍：</>转换为常驻房间后，在<Assistant_Red>退出常驻语音房间或离线后</>仍可保留语音房间，房主仍可保留房主身份。<Assistant_Red>常驻语音房间无法转让房主。</>\n<Assistant_Title2>数量限制：</>每个角色最多仅可拥有<Assistant_Red>1个常驻语音房间</>。\n<Assistant_Title2>解散房间：</>常驻语音房间可由房主主动解散，解散后<Assistant_Red>无法恢复</>；\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[语音房-房主权限]|1395}，{SendAnswer:[语音房-普通语音房]|1396}，{SendAnswer:[语音房-玩法语音房]|1397}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Voice Room - Permanent Room】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Play Voice Room - Settings (Bottom Right) - Permanent Button (Top Right)</>{JumpToUI:[【View】]|1250316}\n<Assistant_Title2>Permanent Item: </>You can purchase a Permanent Contract in the <Assistant_System>Mall - Secret Collection</>. Using it converts a Play Voice Room into a permanent room and adds 30 days of permanent duration. A single item can extend the duration by 30 days, with a maximum cumulative extension of 90 days.\n<Assistant_Title2>Function Introduction: </>After converting to a permanent room, the voice room will be retained even after you <Assistant_Red>exit the permanent voice room or go offline</>, and the host will retain their host status.<Assistant_Red>Permanent voice rooms cannot have their host status transferred.</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quantity Limit: </>Each character can own a maximum of <Assistant_Red>1 permanent voice room</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Disbanding the Room: </>A permanent voice room can be disbanded by the host; once disbanded, it <Assistant_Red>cannot be recovered</>;\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Host Permissions]|1395}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Standard]|1396}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Gameplay]|1397}",
