    ["　　<InvDefault_HW> 1351年2月20日 </>\n　　<InvDefault_HW>今天是与大部队走散的第十天。时间越久，返回的希望就越渺茫。</>\n　　……\n　　<InvDefault_HW>1351年3月4日</>\n　　<InvDefault_HW>走散的第二十二天，情况在逐渐变坏，食物要耗尽了，更重要的是，环绕的弗萨克人彻底困住了我们。</>\n　　……"] = "<InvDefault_HW> February 20, 1351 </> \n <InvDefault_HW> Today is the tenth day since I got separated from the main force. The longer time passes, the slimmer the hope of returning becomes. </> \n ... \n <InvDefault_HW> March 4, 1351 </> \n <InvDefault_HW> The twenty-second day of being separated, the situation is gradually worsening. Food is about to run out, and more importantly, the surrounding Feysacians have completely trapped us. </> \n ...",
